{"id":"pointed-inquiry","name":"Pointed Inquiry","type":"Scout Rifle","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3e3cffd872a5ed87dbefad743cff8e13.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/297296830.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed","s":{"943549884":10,"2715839340":30}},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed","s":{"155624089":10,"943549884":-5,"2715839340":10}},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed","s":{"155624089":5,"943549884":5,"1240592695":5}},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil","s":{"943549884":-10,"1240592695":10,"2715839340":10}},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability","s":{"155624089":5,"943549884":15}},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed","s":{"155624089":-10,"943549884":-5,"1240592695":15}},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range","s":{"1240592695":10}},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability","s":{"155624089":10}},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability","s":{"155624089":7,"1240592695":7}},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed","s":{"943549884":-15,"1240592695":10}}]},{"label":"Magazine","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Extended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/66cfea124e24e73cca1ce6370b44ca7e.png","desc":"This weapon has a greatly increased magazine size, but reloads much slower.\n  •  Greatly increases magazine size\n  •  Greatly decreases reload speed\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness","s":{"2714457168":10,"3871231066":30,"4188031367":-20}},{"name":"Alloy Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/069170916c98748b7b3e33b80bd7d689.png","desc":"Faster reload when the magazine is nearly empty."},{"name":"Appended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9f468cce26fe35d9db413e2f8451127.png","desc":"This weapon's magazine is built for higher capacity.\n  •  Increases magazine size","s":{"3871231066":20}},{"name":"Armor-Piercing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b311ef00478243e21e2a5eec3a59f9d8.png","desc":"Rounds cause extra damage to combatants' shields and overpenetrate targets. \n  •  Slightly increases range","s":{"1240592695":5}},{"name":"High-Caliber Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d1c49edb2d2b24c74067742c09fd5a5.png","desc":"Shots from this weapon knock the target back farther.\n  •  Slightly increases range","s":{"1240592695":5}},{"name":"Ricochet Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a494d0442b32aff8c30d8b2b53561bd.png","desc":"Rounds ricochet off hard surfaces. \n  •  Increases stability \n  •  Slightly increases range","s":{"155624089":10,"1240592695":5}},{"name":"Flared Magwell","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f95e67e4ff37466505d66d3fa1030782.png","desc":"Optimized for fast reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed","s":{"155624089":5,"4188031367":15}},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range","s":{"1240592695":5,"4188031367":10}},{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range","s":{"1240592695":10}},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size","s":{"155624089":5,"3871231066":10,"4188031367":10}},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size.","s":{"4188031367":30}},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness","s":{"155624089":15,"1240592695":-5,"2714457168":7}}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Firmly Planted","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/379796d2e74676d3790f0bd485ea03a9.png","desc":"Increased accuracy, stability, and handling when firing while crouched."},{"name":"Genesis","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/087a911353a3586f5346a1cf88d8de05.png","desc":"Breaking a combatant's shield with this weapon fills its magazine from reserves. Energy weapons regenerate ammo on hit when matching the damage type to the combatant's shield."},{"name":"Fourth Time's the Charm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a5edd4e751e1aa34bf8328a63b121e71.png","desc":"Rapidly landing precision hits will return two rounds to the magazine."},{"name":"Compulsive Reloader","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ef5843dfe8134c7385945216ece2bb06.png","desc":"Grants increased reload speed when close to full magazine."},{"name":"Shoot to Loot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e8c6e23afe3c4215f0dc0c2941500c28.png","desc":"Shooting an Orb of Power picks it up. Shooting an ammo brick picks it up and automatically reloads all of your equipped weapons from reserves."},{"name":"Stats for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8aadd7fd25c2b1e9f3fc7f4411a97ea4.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases weapon handling, stability, reload, and range for a moderate duration."},{"name":"Repulsor Brace","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/cfcbde3872d34c5258fd8227640a020e.png","desc":"Defeating a Void-debuffed target grants an overshield."},{"name":"Rapid Hit","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/de22847fa94634a487758041887bcdaa.png","desc":"Rapid precision hits temporarily increase stability and reload speed."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Adaptive Munitions","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3b952f8ba0c9afce1a0cc081d23ece03.png","desc":"This weapon adapts its damage output and effectiveness against energy shields that don't match the weapon's damage type."},{"name":"Demolitionist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/da009697110e06b65d6f827b3b6d5f70.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate grenade energy. Activating your grenade ability reloads this weapon from reserves."},{"name":"Dragonfly","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c87b03bb6d56b393f8582e128b337332.png","desc":"Precision kills create an elemental damage explosion."},{"name":"Turnabout","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/02786692ea8de976f059b01b4450a67e.png","desc":"Using this weapon to break the shield of a combatant or a Guardian using their Super will grant you an overshield."},{"name":"Focused Fury","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/15fb47018719c99ae37d10f794bc957e.png","desc":"Dealing a portion of the magazine as precision damage grants this weapon bonus damage. The shot count is reset whenever the weapon is reloaded or stowed."},{"name":"Harmony","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a3c1c5e1cb05adef7cf6af6602a0da0.png","desc":"Final blows with other weapons improve this weapon's damage and performance for a short duration."},{"name":"Demoralize","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8cabe60ab649baa54f0f50a59034155d.png","desc":"Precision final blows cause nearby targets to become weakened."},{"name":"Precision Instrument","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e6a4ebc1a8a73e4c7fcfc21c69000ce2.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage increases precision damage."}]}],"notes":["pandapaxxy (PvE / M+KB / Controller): \"Pointed Inquiry is a little underwhelming. All 150 scouts are not the best stat wise but Pointed Inquiry has lower base stats than Perses-D. Where it makes up for that is in its utility with max extending perks and adaptive munitions. This allows Pointed Inquiry to have a solid foothold in higher level activities with match game. [...] 150s do have their merit and can put in work in grandmaster nightfalls, but in general day-to-day the faster firing archetypes just do the job better.\". Recommended MW - Reload.","pandapaxxy (PvP / M+KB): \"In PvP, Pointed Inquiry just lacks the perk pool to really excel in anything. Niches aside, the perk pool just does not lend itself to any sort of player vs player activity.\". Recommended MW - Handling.","pandapaxxy (PvP / Controller): \"In PvP, Pointed Inquiry just lacks the perk pool to really excel in anything. Niches aside, the perk pool just does not lend itself to any sort of player vs player activity.\". Recommended MW - Stability.","Inspired by DMB Player Versus Enemies Podcast 8. Shapeable through the Mars Relic. PvE first choice roll for end-game PvE, although it's not a strong subtype, it does have some interesting perk pairings and might be worth keeping in case of a sandbox change. Barrel and mag depend on your preferences, although improving recoil direction and/or stability can be useful. Genesis pairs well with either Turnabout for extra shields or Adaptive Munitions, to keep firing after a shield is broken. Recommended MW: Stability or Reload Speed, with a Backup Mag or damage-boosting (Minor, Major or Taken Spec) mod.","Inspired by DMB Player Versus Enemies Podcast 8. Shapeable through the Mars Relic. PvE first choice roll for end-game PvE, although it's not a strong subtype, it does have some interesting perk pairings and might be worth keeping in case of a sandbox change. Barrel and mag depend on your preferences, although improving recoil direction and/or stability can be useful. Focused Fury procs on crit hits from half the bullets in a base magazine, so Fourth Time's The Charm extends the damage for longer. Recommended MW: Stability or Reload Speed, with a Backup Mag or damage-boosting (Minor, Major or Taken Spec) mod.","Inspired by DMB Player Versus Enemies Podcast 8. Shapeable through the Mars Relic. PvE backup roll for end-game PvE, although it's not a strong subtype, it does have some interesting perk pairings and might be worth keeping in case of a sandbox change. Barrel and mag depend on your preferences, although improving recoil direction and/or stability can be useful. Focused Fury procs on crit hits from half the bullets in a base magazine, and Shoot To Loot's automatic reload keeps the damage boost going on shooting an ammo brick to pick it up. Recommended MW: Stability or Reload Speed, with a Backup Mag or damage-boosting (Minor, Major or Taken Spec) mod.","[YeezyGT's WQ] [MW: Handling] \"Pointed Inquiry's main synergy comes in the form of Genesis + Adaptive Munitions/Turnabout. Shoot to Loot/Dragonfly has nice synergy, though with this 150RPM, I primarily see this as a high-level content, ranged-engagement weapon that you may end up using somewhat sparingly, if at all. Most perks should work here, though I'd rate it pretty low on the Scout Rifle food chain.\" tags:pve","Chevy's S16 Super Pog PvE Loot List. Recommended MW - Reload"],"craftable":true,"sources":["Exploring the Throne World"],"activities":[],"hash":297296830,"vendors":["Fynch"],"frame":"High-Impact Frame","stats":{"list":[{"h":4284893193,"name":"Rounds Per Minute","max":100,"num":true,"interp":[[0,120],[20,150],[60,180],[80,200],[100,260]]},{"h":4043523819,"name":"Impact","max":100,"num":false,"interp":[[0,45],[20,60],[40,62],[80,67],[100,100]]},{"h":1240592695,"name":"Range","max":100,"num":false,"interp":[[0,0],[100,100]]},{"h":155624089,"name":"Stability","max":100,"num":false,"interp":[[0,0],[100,100]]},{"h":943549884,"name":"Handling","max":100,"num":false,"interp":[[0,0],[100,100]]},{"h":4188031367,"name":"Reload Speed","max":100,"num":false,"interp":[[0,0],[100,100]]},{"h":3871231066,"name":"Magazine","max":100,"num":true,"interp":[[0,10],[9,10],[10,11],[19,11],[20,12],[29,12],[30,13],[39,13],[40,14],[49,14],[50,15],[59,15],[60,16],[69,16],[70,17],[79,17],[80,18],[89,18],[90,19],[99,19],[100,20]]},{"h":1345609583,"name":"Aim Assistance","max":100,"num":false,"interp":[[0,0],[100,100]]},{"h":3555269338,"name":"Zoom","max":100,"num":false,"interp":[[0,0],[100,100]]},{"h":2715839340,"name":"Recoil Direction","max":100,"num":true,"interp":[[0,0],[100,100]]},{"h":2714457168,"name":"Airborne Effectiveness","max":100,"num":false,"interp":[[0,